- **R-054 | p.17 Пифия — replica predictor** — purpose: world answer never lags the replica; Паганель reads land, Пифия reads player. Gathers the replica-work block spread across loops (psychotype p.6, mood p.8-2, intent p.9, player patterns p.10) into one role with one output artifact; implements p.11 «engine predicts branches». Two artifacts: карта игрока — long-lived DB profile (psychotype, mood, interests, habits, avoidance areas), accumulated at nights from patterns (p.10), lives months; гороскоп — per-scene release: answer branches (p.11: negative, positive, aside; negative → instant DB record, positive → assembled Ткач prompt), Пила forecast (p.6: эхо or контрапункт), topics = which bank segment to forge (p.8-7); lives until topic change, then reworked in мастерская. Two execution levels: мастерская (pauses/night) full run (player card + scene + Пила → гороскоп, ковка by relevance p.7); сцена (живой ход) mechanics only — early typing vectors (p.9) checked against гороскоп, match = ready branch served instantly, no generation on scene. Three limits: (1) advice not sentence — Селектор may ignore (Пила precedent p.6); гороскоп realized only if player came there themselves; (2) stop-kran: unconfirmed branch writes nothing; (3) miss not forced: replica outside forecast → branch not served, goes to оседание candidates (p.11). Censorship at ковка applies to гороскоп without exceptions (p.4). Гороскоп forged by Гефест on Пифия order (p.18). Inheritance: inputs alive in TNS35 (Jung profiler 14 metrics p.6, night pattern statistics p.10); item sets role and bounds, builds no new mechanics. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:354–371. Status: CANON.
- **R-055 | p.10 оседание of live scenes** — successful live scenes reworked into reusable bank records in DB; applies to experience too: session player patterns (bargaining style, topics pulled, avoided: mechanical stats + vector topics p.8) compacted at night into thread memory and ковка plan (p.7); experience = data not text: no per-item review, goes to night сводка. Only full live scenes passing live-turn checks (fact validator, dictionary censorship) оседают; рутина never оседает (already in bank). Cleaning: cuts engine-substituted values (names, things, prices, places) → slots; unremovable (pronouns, retelling) marked for авто-критик, verdict feeds trust level; original kept beside for checking. Semantic dedup rejects scenes duplicating an existing record's meaning per key. Trust level (ex-«утверждение») issued by fully mechanical conveyor: live checks → cleaning → dedup → авто-критик. Авто-критик = Гефест function in мастерская (small model, offline/night; no new entity), Паганель = prefilter (p.16). High (checks clean, like or no remarks) → record to all three consumer roles at once; low (авто-критик remarks, dislike-borderline) → only draft for Ткач, never straight to player. Three consumer roles (p.2 boundary intact): insurance on Ткач silence, middle stylization layer on flat segments, draft for Ткач in a similar moment; peak still live Ткач. Storage: literary.db of own world; between worlds only through Forge; storage priority = scarce keys of ковка plan (p.7) — оседание = third пряжа source beside book and станок. Owner sees no lists: осевшее visible post-factum in logs/UI, intervention = распоряжение (выкинуть/понизить/повысить = workshop order), right not duty. Лайк/дизлайк in chat: direct quality signal — лайк raises scene's оседание priority; дизлайк rejects. TNS35 roles inherited whole: likes nudge narrow literary parameters (clamp ±15%, step 0.02, neutral = no shift, NOT psychotype); dislike 1st in a row = soft regeneration of last scene, 2nd in a row = rollback to player's raw turn. Hybrid mapping: on рутина dislike = instant re-pick of another bank record, 0 LLM; «перепиши мягче» = Ткач instruction on deep path; dislike reason suggested by Пила/настроение (TNS35 had one hardcoded «слишком агрессивно»). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:373–389. Status: CANON.
- **R-056 | p.13 chapter and book** — chapter = session log without edits (turns, replicas, journal); never generated separately — fixed by fact of play. Time pace always 1:1: world never drifts vs player in play, pauses, or sleep. Time jump only by player declaration in replica («весь день поднимался в гору»); pack time detector returns field «время» with quote (word forms: time units + numerals + prepositions «через»/«спустя», no LLM). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:394–398. Status: CANON.
- **R-057 | Jump rules** — up to a day: instant jump (near circle recomputed by jump, far circle lazy in мастерская by fate vectors p.7; replay p.15); circle discrepancies not masked — delivered as lagging news («вести в этом мире действительно идут неделями»). Over a day = workshop order, world state recomputed in pause. Пила doesn't grow on a jump (no replicas = no data); world faces advance their drift (p.19). Jump never empty: way stated briefly and factually (рутина, Челнок — «долго и без событий»), and by jump end (evening/night) world may serve a surprise: Ткач or DB заготовка (Пифия гороскоп p.17); not every jump (else fast-forward becomes an adventure-call button — «предчувствие» precedent). If player doesn't continue, Селектор hints a possible event or seeds a hook into next morning's пробуждение. Quiet stretch = convenient world move: player writes montage, world answers with event (p.19). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:400–402. Status: CANON.
- **R-058 | Chapter = game day frame** — from пробуждение to sleep; sleep closes a day of any length. Replica «легли спать» = finale: closes chapter and session; after a long session it's the standard finale and explicit application for the next session. Engine never creates sessions: next session opens only by player arrival; world never initiates contact or starts first; next-day пробуждение pre-forged in мастерская (утро главы below) and served on return. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:404. Status: CANON.
- **R-059 | Prose in player's key** — engine generates: player style transferred by example in prompt; стилизация под классика allowed (external model, batch, not live turn); no manual chapter insert needed; chapter interpretation/morals outside engine loop (never formulated or imposed). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:406. Status: CANON.
- **R-060 | Editing scope** — редактура only grammar and punctuation; content never manually edited. Log kept unedited as source of truth for checks; the book (publishable chapter version, incl. player typos/punctuation) is what gets edited. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:408. Status: CANON.
- **R-061 | Редактор** — external model, batch mode, cheap tariff (built-in pipeline can't pull a 30–40k-token chapter: hours at ~5.6 tok/s; 3B weak in Russian orthography). Chapter cut into scenes of 2–4k tokens; punctuation sheet fixed (dash, «ёлочки», ellipsis). Edit format = MD: Редактор submits edit list (было → стало), never republishes whole text. After text processing Редактор generates chapter summary (5–6 sentences) in section `## Краткое содержание` — one request, one model. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:410. Status: CANON.
- **R-062 | Цензор правок — five code rules** — (1) source/result words aligned 1:1, composition and order unchanged; (2) insertion, deletion, reordering of words fully banned; (3) bearing words (proper names, numbers, negations) never edited under any conditions; (4) allowed word edit = orthography (compound/separate/hyphen, stress vowels, obvious typos); prose punctuation free; MD markup (headings, emphasis) inviolable; (5) fact control: after edit Цензор checks world(name).db entities (names, places, items), mismatch = reject. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:412–418. Status: CANON.
- **R-063 | Rejected edits** — edit failing Цензор auto-rejected; player sees rejected in book window tab «Правки Цензора». Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:420. Status: CANON.
- **R-064 | Repeat rule** — word «wrong» the same way ≥3 times = possibly intentional (name, new concept, slang; e.g. «олдбанский») → not edited; becomes candidate for world lexicon (night-ковка input, p.8-3). If the repeating word has a dictionary neighbor within ≤2 letters → likely systematic typo: word edited but with a line in night дайджест («возможно намеренное»). Word already in world lexicon never edited. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:422. Status: CANON.
- **R-065 | Утро главы (game-day opening)** — chapter = game day; opening = session creation, created by player's arrival; 30-s timer works inside the session the player created. Пробуждение pre-forged: ковка of пробуждение queued from first pause after chapter end (p.7); by end of 8-hour window пробуждение surely in DB; served instantly without live generation (live generation = fallback when no pause between chapters). Two opening branches: (1) player writes immediately: replica opens chapter, world instantly answers with forgen пробуждение; while player reads it, deep parse of their replica runs (once per chapter) and engine prepares relevant answer — reading time covers parse+generation, no idle; (2) player passive: 30-s timer after chapter creation = заготовка selection window for passive opening; engine picks fitting DB record (criteria = состав пробуждения) and opens the day itself; player's reply to it = chapter's first replica. Состав пробуждения: 3 last turns of previous chapter, stats, portrait, position; sleep state inherited from bedtime (after drinking — heavy head and late sun; after hard labor — brokenness); landscape and small feeling (ray, cold, damp, sound) by portrait; goal = provoke player answer. No hooks in пробуждение: mood unknown, open threads untouched. Timer only at chapter opening; later pauses normal — world never rushes. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:424–433. Status: CANON.
- **R-066 | Deep parse of first replica** — once per chapter (other replicas give mood only, p.6); one cheap LLM call (p.14), not a separate live-turn stage: latency hidden in пробуждение-reading window (branch 1) or answer-assembly window; per-word vectorization already in conveyor (p.9). JSON fields «намерение / план / предчувствие / незакрытая тема», each with quote from player's replica (not retelling); field below confidence threshold ignored. Fields go to Ткач facts and Пифия player card (p.17). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:435. Status: CANON.
- **R-067 | After deep parse** — Селектор may submit a hook on an open thread or trigger an event by mood, anxiety, stats, portrait (replica «плохо спал, было предчувствие» raises event weight for the day). Not every предчувствие realizes same day — else «предчувствие» becomes an adventure-call button; big event = workshop order, fires через главу. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:437. Status: CANON.
- **R-068 | «Моя книга» window** — modal window, text editor; player opens from menu and sees: Краткое содержание = дайджест of current chapter (5–6 sentences, generated by Редактор after text processing); tabs: Содержание (all chapters list, navigation), Глава (full edited text), Правки Цензора (what Редактор changed, what was rejected), Сырой лог (unedited session log, optional); editor mode: player edits errors in chapter text right in the window. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:439–443. Status: CANON.
- **R-069 | Death, finale, replay** — book belongs to player: death and finale decided by player, engine/world not in power over completion. World asks decision once and waits, no rush: accept as book finale / replay / new world. Two replay forms on inherited event sourcing (p.15: replay+snapshots): мир-который-помнит keeps past hero in world history (corpse or legend, ружьё и тайна, p.12); мир-который-забыл resets all — no attempt in history, honest new sheet. Synopsis at replay = player's choice: keep or rewrite. «Предложение, а не принуждение: невыполненный синопсис — трагедия, а трагедия тоже книга». Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:445. Status: CANON.
- **R-070 | Эпилог** — practically standalone chapter, written by the player = the only pure-authorship chapter; player marks important/turning moments (scenes, chapters) = author marking of book peaks. Data consumers: оседание priorities (p.10), book assembly (contents + dramatis personae), annotation (заявка rework with actual content — part II block), regression sessions, Пифия prediction calibration (p.17) on following books. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:447. Status: CANON.
- **R-071 | p.4 permanent caveats and language law** — dictionary censorship done at ковка for all ready-artifact pools in DB, both subtypes (рутина and драма). «Язык — упаковка данных, не архитектура» («English inside» cancelled, migration 55→65): core universal, world working language = player's language, source books forged in own language without forced translation. Dictionary mechanics (intent lexicon, ban-lists, time/mood detectors) lives in the language pack — swappable layer on par with models (p.14); first pack = Russian. Translation = one-time pack-build operation: base seed pools translated to pack language in one voice. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:453–455. Status: CANON.
- **R-072 | p.19 world = antagonist** — world is a system with own dynamics, not backdrop/service; world resistance = input of story pressure. Лица мира: at each moment someone physically embodies resistance — NPC with archetype, personal motive, pressure caliber; faces fed by world conflicts (religious, estate, economic). Эстафета: after a face is displaced (killed, bypassed, won over) tension transfers to next carrier along links — world cannot be finished by removing one villain. Сопротивление чужому: player-brought inadequacy (anachronism — «Янки при дворе короля Артура») neither ignored nor accepted without reaction: answer by world laws (nепонимание, ересь, переплавка in own history); reaction choice = Селектор at planning (p.11); big foreign = workshop order (p.7). Frame links: Пила (p.6) = pressure sensor, faces = carriers; fate-without-player (p.12) shows independent world; Chekhov guns (p.12) = registered answer inventory. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:457–467. Status: CANON.

