- **R-082 | TNS35 data contracts as reference point** — literary.db 9 tables: worlds, works, chunks (+ text_en + vectors), styles, personas, templates, quests, world_drafts (Forge+review write, runtime strictly readonly). world.db 22 tables: faces, relations (6 layers), npc_memory, entities, places/routes (provenance: book/generated/external/paganel/hearsay; status: promise→draft→baked), world_clock, deferred_events, events, runtime_gaps, quest_journal, economy, player_profile, world_meta, sessions, graph, npc_state. WORLD_WRITERS: forge → places, routes, world_meta; runtime → other 19. TNS35 runtime RoleplayEngine: State-First conveyor Intent → Simulation → State → Context → Prose, 12 turn steps; facade :8000, Telegram bridge, :5001, :5002. Source: DOCS/02-ARCHITECTURE.md:190–200. Status: PLAN.
