- **R-086 | 03 live-turn walkthrough (steps 0–6)** — step 0 intake (Replica{session_id, chapter_id, ts}; Telegram whole on Enter, web word-streaming, edited = new replica); step 1 mechanical (lemma «надсмотрщик/отпустить/…», «не» separate; vectorization per sentence + whole; scene frame from world DB); step 2 hypothesis+preselect in parallel; step 3 Пила advises / Селектор decides (stop-kran to step 6); step 4 Ткач path: FACTS from world(name).db + INSTRUCTION (emotion, no new facts, language), prompt ≈1500–2000 tokens → 200–300 tokens ≈ 35–55 s; step 5 streaming underlay; step 6 confirmation (dictionary + vector; dictionary beats vector) then commit (events, replica, answer, relation shift −3→−4, NPC memory record). Variants: flat Челнок path; insurance at silence threshold ~45 s (working value). Source: DOCS/03-LIVE-TURN.md:7–137. Status: PLAN.
- **R-087 | Slot token table (binder)** — fixed ASCII tokens: [NPCname] / [NPCnameActive] / [NPCnamePassive] (pair covers two acting persons), [NPCrole] (nameless roles: пастырь, пророк, мытарь…), [NPCroleDeity] (unstoppable force: deity in mystic world or стихия/закон/судьба without mystic), [NPCgroup] (third+ participants), [PLACE] (toponym). Substitution at preselect step, code without LLM: (1) NPC search in Труппа/пачка by tags (geography, estate, sex); (2) declension = pack lemmatizer + NPC card (gender, cases); (3) binding to world(name).db, lives scene or chapter; (4) same token in two arcs of one chapter = different persons (binding numbers compared). Rule: [NPCroleDeity] and outcome-power roles bind to influential entity/стихия, never a random mortal (else «кузнец наслал потоп»). Source: DOCS/03-LIVE-TURN.md:170–193. Status: PLAN.
- **R-088 | Numbers table (03)** — deep scene local 30–60 s (канон); станок speed ~5.6 tok/s (working); peak prompt/answer ~1500–2000 / ~200–300 tokens (working); Ткач silence threshold ~45 s (working); passive chapter-open timer 30 s (working); like corrections ±15%, step 0.02 (TNS35 heritage). Source: DOCS/03-LIVE-TURN.md:304–313. Status: PLAN.
- **R-089 | Pause ladder table (04)** — stage 1 ≥10 min (light, mechanics only), stage 2 >1 h (more complex ковка), stage 3 >3 h (heavy: new NPC elaboration, deep заготовки), Night: silence >8 h after chapter end (full варка, next-chapter пробуждение); stages cumulative. Source: DOCS/04-WORKSHOP.md:17–30. Status: PLAN.
