- **R-096 | World birth fill (05)** — folder created: world(name).db by recipe (schema) + literary.db seeded from pack; анкета 4 fields written; same button: пачка 96 cards (16×6) under строй/экономика; anchor by vectors; Forge writes exactly three things (places, routes, world_meta); мастерская orders external models for analysis + whole-book ковка plan; no ready prose at birth; raw source books (txt, fb2) live as files in world folder, only forgen content enters DBs. Source: DOCS/05-DATABASES.md:92–101. Status: PLAN.
- **R-097 | Пачка + доковка (05)** — card content: psychotype, estate, archetype, voice, looks; no backstory through second обращение; secret not set at birth. Use: binder-tag search (geography, estate, sex) → mechanical substitution, declension by card. Доковка: no fit → workshop order (Forge stage-3 pause) by required dramatic arc + Пифия score; card to world(name).db пачка; never forge new cards in the live turn. Source: DOCS/05-DATABASES.md:117–127. Status: PLAN.
- **R-098 | Record examples (05)** — base.db `patterns` (id joseph_brothers, archetype rise, slots [NPCname, NPCnameActive, NPCnamePassive, PLACE], language ru, vector computed at build); literary.db `templates` (archetype trade, pattern{situation/intention/conflict/emotion}, slots, provenance generated, trust high, language ru); world db `places` (name/essence/owner/known_by/provenance paganel/status draft) and `events` (ts epoch ms, group_name, npc_id, description, meta{offline:true, source:vector_of_fate}). Source: DOCS/05-DATABASES.md:131–183. Status: PLAN.
- **R-099 | Vector + atlas contracts (05)** — bge-m3, dim 1024, vector computed on the ORIGINAL text (never translation), stored BLOB (Float32 little-endian); provenance set book/generated/external/paganel/hearsay; status chain promise → draft → baked. Source: DOCS/05-DATABASES.md:187–195. Status: PLAN.
- **R-100 | TNS35 table orientation (05)** — literary.db 9 tables, world.db 22 tables enumeration for the builder; TNS65 world(name).db inherits these contracts, changes only the four listed differences. Source: DOCS/05-DATABASES.md:197–204. Status: PLAN.
- **R-101 | Role requirements table (06)** — lemmatizer (code), Ткач/Редактор (model, swappable slot), deep parse (external slot or local станок) with per-role requirements per R-008; presets and insurance per R-010; model manager lifecycle per R-011. Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:7–23. Status: PLAN.
- **R-102 | Станок layout (06)** — :5001 generation 3B q4 (~5.6 tok/s, raised only for deep scenes), :5002 embeddings BGE-M3 dim 1024 (~2.4 GB, live-loop resident), lemmatizer pymorphy3 (~100 MB); combined memory ≈ 0.1 + 2.4 GB; vector on ORIGINAL text (TNS35 contract). Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:27–39. Status: PLAN.
- **R-103 | Language pack layers (06)** — four layers: ядро (algorithms + taxonomy identifiers: archetype/slot/position/metric names) never translated (ASCII JSON-key constants; English keyword lists never ported into core); языковой пакет (morphology, lemma dicts, lexicon, ban-lists, labels) per-language data; сид (drama forms, phrase cushion, dicts) prose in pack language; Ткач receives form in pack language, writes in pack language. Rules: seed structures (names of archetypes, slots, positions, metrics) = identifiers shared across packs; translation = one-time pack-build op, not role/loop; base seed banks translated in one voice. First pack = Russian. Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:53–68. Status: PLAN.
- **R-104 | Seed bake plan steps + numbers (06)** — full run over 66 books (not just 15 key), ≈840 archetypes (248 existing + ≈590 new at density 0.71/chapter), seven languages (en/ru/de/fr/es/ja/zh) in one DB with language sections; seed size: anonymized narratives ~2 MB×7 + phrase cushion ~27 MB ≈ 28–29 MB. Steps: 1 code clean raw (drop 2 LEB verses; check 31 095 verses, two PD sources); 1-bis code token substitution before LLM (table by verse_id: 43 names, 10 446 mentions; family dicts; tokens [NPCname]/[NPCnameActive]/[NPCnamePassive]/[NPCrole]/[NPCroleDeity]/[NPCgroup]/[PLACE]; max 2 name slots per fragment, identical tokens never two persons, third+ = [NPCgroup]/background); 2 model cheap slot bake forms over 66 books (identifiers + descriptors situation/intention/conflict/emotional function straight into pack language; ≈2.5–3 M tokens, $0.5–1, hours of batch); 3 code form validation (schema, taxonomy slots, cited verses exist; dictionary censorship; semantic dedup; failures → re-bake); 3-bis code output control (token survival oracle: output token multiset = input; loss → one fix + one repeat; regex neutrality safety: name/sacred-word dictionary by word boundary; match → defect, one fix + one repeat; second fail → exclusion list; no content-based rejection); 4 model phrase cushion translation ×7 (batches 10–20 verses); 5 code+model lemma dict of pack (translate lists + synonyms; run over 1 189 chapters; quality metrics; fix loop to stability); 6 code pack packaging (pymorphy3, dicts, seed, versions, integrity, rollback — by model-manager pattern); 7 model next languages (separate распоряжение; recommended re-run forms with output in pack language). Plan does not: edit canon, run bakes, download models, write source, touch live loop; product = seed in TNS65 repo; acceptance thresholds = owner распоряжение. Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:72–132. Status: PLAN.
- **R-105 | Dictionary quality (06)** — two independent properties: полнота (coverage — are all archetype lemmas listed) and чистота (purity — no extra lemmas); measured by mechanical runs; acceptance threshold = owner распоряжение; imperfection hurts материал запекание quality, not live play (live replica understood by intent lexicon + vector). Lemma-in-two-lists conflict = not a defect, resolved by counts and weights. Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:106–108. Status: PLAN.
- **R-106 | Цензор при варке rules (06)** — cleans banks once at ковка output before DB write; priority = style, not content: archaic/heavy narration → modern literary language (in extraction/translation prompts); phrase cushion exception (verbatim preserved as insurance пряжа); names never blocked (name pool goes whole, no exceptions); mysticism = not censorship but tag-property `mystic` (e.g. «превращение воды в вино — mystic»), field added to classifier, zero extra calls; at binding Ткач reads tag together with world's mystic allow/deny key (deny → piece not taken or чудо reframed as примета/молва/закон); live-turn dictionary censorship stays a separate mechanism. Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:114–126. Status: PLAN.
- **R-107 | Труппа rules table + порог смерти (07)** — rules table per R-036 with executor notes (birth/meetings code; secret assignment Селектор; reactions/bindings world(name).db). Порог смерти separate block: threshold 2% (working value), guaranteed farewell scene, before threshold no forced death; owner quote cited in MECHANICS (R-137). Source: DOCS/07-THEATER-AND-WORLD.md:7–35. Status: PLAN.
- **R-108 | Пачка and доковка (07)** — 96 cards (16×6, канон) generated under строй/экономика; card = psychotype, estate, archetype, voice, looks; without пачка first hour of play on empty stage. Source: DOCS/07-THEATER-AND-WORLD.md:37–43. Status: PLAN.
- **R-109 | World antagonist + сценарная рамка tables (07)** — faces/эстафета/сопротивление чужому with executors (Селектор + code); anchor table (anchor/start/drift/retention/switch/invisibility/feed) with executors per R-028. Source: DOCS/07-THEATER-AND-WORLD.md:47–87. Status: PLAN.
- **R-110 | Chapter/book blocks (07)** — chapter log as-is; time 1:1 + jump rules; редактура/Цензор per R-060–R-064; «Моя книга» tabs; заявка block (storage text+vector, three uses, boundary); death/replay («Предлагать, не навязывать…» owner wording); эпилог consumers list. Source: DOCS/07-THEATER-AND-WORLD.md:91–137. Status: PLAN.
- **R-111 | World birth checklist (07)** — 7 steps: анкета 4 fields; world(name).db + literary.db with pack seed; пачка 96; anchor by vectors; Forge writes exactly places/routes/world_meta; workshop order for analysis + whole-book ковка plan (no ready prose); raw source books txt+fb2 as files in world folder. Source: DOCS/07-THEATER-AND-WORLD.md:141–151. Status: PLAN.
